    "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/Supermarine_Spitfire_Vb_%E2%80%98BM597_-_JH-C%E2%80%99_%28G-MKVB%29_%2819765614018%29.jpg",
    "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Supermarine_Spitfire_Vb_%E2%80%98BM597_-_JH-C%E2%80%99_(G-MKVB)_(19765614018).jpg",
    "width": 5382,
